{"id":"4eb90c09079841ed","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity.md","title":"PCP 解等价于合并文法的歧义","display":"thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity — PCP 解等价于合并文法的歧义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity","aliases":["73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity"],"display":"thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity — PCP 解等价于合并文法的歧义","depends_on":["[[73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2, Theorem 9.20, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity — PCP 解等价于合并文法的歧义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddee155bb5d30192\" href=\"?note=ddee155bb5d30192\" title=\"73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity\">73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2, Theorem 9.20, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,G_A(I),G_B(I),G_{AB}(I)\">\\(I,G_A(I),G_B(I),G_{AB}(I)\\)</span> 采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\mathbf2}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\nL(G_A(I))\\cap L(G_B(I))\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G_{AB}(I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\mathbf2}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\nL(G_A(I))\\cap L(G_B(I))\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G_{AB}(I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一逆序索引尾部强制两侧用完全相同的块序列，两侧产出相同恰为 PCP 解。每个分支内部无歧义，合并文法若有两个解析，只能分别经 S→A 与 S→B；这也排除了“某一个分支已歧义”的伪反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"ddee155bb5d30192","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,G_A(I),G_B(I),G_{AB}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\mathbf2}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\nL(G_A(I))\\cap L(G_B(I))\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ambiguous}(G_{AB}(I)).","display":true}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity|PCP 解等价于合并文法的歧义]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"378dfa121b0216f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ddee155bb5d30192"]}